# T_SCRR: the audit log exported with field names: first to a directory
# that does not exist (200 naming FILE, shown on the file field in the
# client's text), then to a file whose export takes more records than
# one request examines, so it goes on after each page's cursor; the
# file is compared with its golden.  The table choice is shown once
# Space has stepped it to the audit log.
K SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE
S AUDIT
K TAB
T nodir/x.csv
K CTRL-S
S NODIR
K CTRL-Y
T exp15.csv
K TAB
T Y
K CTRL-S
S EXPORTED
K ESC
